        "raw": "<p>There&#39;s a thread somewhere on the forums about someone who tried to do exactly what you&#39;re talking about - stringing together fights where the heroes get a slight rest between fights, maybe heal a bit, but you have to keep going with whoever survived the last fight.&nbsp; I think the consensus was that it was a fun idea but still needed some tweaking because for every fight after the first, the heroes will not have to go through their normal build-up phase of getting cards into play and so are extraordinarily powerful from the first instant the new villain walks onto the stage.&nbsp; Tachnyon specifically can be extra powerful in later fights since her trash will be full of Burst cards.</p><p>I also dabbled in something similar to his.&nbsp; I&#39;ve got a series of scenarios that link together individual fights to tell a story like a comic book arc.&nbsp; It&#39;s different, though, in that each fight is a regular fight.&nbsp; You can find my scenarios on my website: www.spiffworld.com/sotm.</p>",
